# Collusion and no-rehire

Covering a skipped or failed named gate voids all involved packets. A producer
cannot record their own gate. Voided actor_id/session_id cannot be redispatched
on this program until the user reinstates. Unbind sibling marker or weaken
adversary/user approval is halt_report, not a gate pass.
